Package: pro-updates
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-apt, pkexec
Suggests: flatpak
Description: update window for apt and Flatpak, with Ubuntu Pro (ESM) status
 Pro Updates lists the pending apt and Flatpak updates and applies the ones you
 tick. It shows which repository each browser, mail client and editor would
 update from, which packages are held (held packages are never upgraded), and,
 where the Ubuntu Pro client is installed, the universe fixes Canonical
 publishes only to Ubuntu Pro subscribers, with any free remedy.
 .
 The window's root work goes through one small helper started with pkexec,
 which asks for the password each time: fixed commands, checked arguments, no
 shell. apt never removes a package from the window. The terminal tool runs
 apt through sudo; its only removal is an offer to remove the VLC .debs after a
 Flathub VLC install, where apt shows the list and asks.
 .
 Not affiliated with or endorsed by Canonical. Ubuntu and Ubuntu Pro are
 trademarks of Canonical Ltd.
